Add a brain-aware ``@@images`` view for catalog brains and contentlisting objects. It exposes the same ``scale``, ``tag``, ``srcset``, ``picture``, and ``getImageSize`` API, answers from ``image_scales`` catalog metadata first, and falls back to the real object only when metadata cannot answer. The metadata path performs no ``getObject()`` calls, supports an explicit HiDPI fallback, and documents the field-resolution and security caveats.
